NOTICE for @magpie-community/page-digital-pet
=============================================

This package is a magpie page/plugin adapter. It does not bundle the upstream
engine, the Digimon catalog, evolution data, or any sprite art.

The engine is an external npm dependency:
@jcendal/opencode-digital-pet 0.18.0 (Apache License 2.0), by Jorge Cendal
(jcendal) and Sergio Bugallo (sbugallo). At runtime that package is installed
by the package manager; it is not vendored into this repository.

The sidebar page draws a deterministic procedural pixel blob for each pet. No
sprite frames or other restricted art assets are shipped in this package or in
the npm tarball.

